The subject operation states the fix round's new facts in place of its former wording: every non-gate subject is materialized in the isolated checkout at the ROUND's deterministic path (checkout_token of the custody retry key) and all deliveries read the frozen subject; the governance root is always the serving body's; a rerun of a round whose seat is still owed rejoins the open operation through the gate's reconcile-only path, revises the same ledger record, pays nothing twice and is exempt from the cycle ceiling, in-process or after a restart; the reuse lookup is staged (bounded hot index first, archived segments only after a miss, disclosed); treat_as_body raises only an unknown body fact.
